+    help="Derive the TCP (L1) and TCC (LLC) sizes from --wfs-per-simd using "
+    "the Radeon VII wavefront ratios. Off by default so that sweeping "
+    "--num-compute-units or --wfs-per-simd does not silently grow the LLC "
