+// Size of the doorbell aperture this device claims on the PIO bus.
+//
+// It must cover everything GPUComputeDriver::mmap() maps onto pioAddr, and the
+// ROCm runtime asks that mmap for 0x2000 -- two pages -- not one. A single page
